    "Name": "Sunder SD1-OX",
    "Details": "A Draconis Combine developed Omni mech, the Sunder is based on reverse engineered Loki and Thor Omnimechs. A 360-rated XL Engine allows the omnimech to carry 15 DHS along with 16.5 tons of armor and 36 tons of weapons. The Sunder SD1-OX is armed with a 4 Enhanced LRM-5’s and 2 Enhanced LRM-10’s. 3 ER Medium Lasers a Medium Pulse Laser act as secondary weapons. \n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Extended Torso Twist</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.11</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Omni</color>",
